# Corpus scenarios are re-normalized to verify the calibration, but the
# generated artifacts are NOT committed -- the fixtures are events.jsonl +
# manifest.json (inputs) and expected.json + README.md + script.ps1 + uia-lib.ps1
# (the ground truth + driver). Mirrors the example-aggregate "don't commit the
# regenerated files" rule. Verify on a COPY, or let these patterns drop the
# in-place outputs.
*/*/annotations.json
*/*/stats.json
*/*/analysis.json
*/*/events.csv
*/*/events.xes
*/*/dfg.json
*/*/*.bpmn
*/*/process_map*.json
*/*/*.docx
*/*/*.log
*/*/logs/
*/*/screenshots/
# Scratch from the out-of-repo harness, should it ever land here.
*/*/_raw-events.jsonl
*/*/_drive.log
